#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 0e5fb0b0d9da44c98c3f4a6c051c2fcb Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:9 a
msgid "Backtesting a Strategy"
msgstr "回测一个策略"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:11 a
#: b3a6edfcc1664d839cb14c920ed4053c
msgid ""
"We are now ready to test a basic trading strategy using **PyBroker**. To "
"get started, import the following classes:"
msgstr "我们现在已经准备好使用 **PyBroker** 测试一个基本的交易策略。首先，导入以下类："

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:60 a
#: eaa975a7940a44ea9b84972920763f3b
msgid ""
"For the backtest, we will use `Yahoo Finance "
"<https://finance.yahoo.com>`__ as our `DataSource "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.DataSource>`__."
" We will also enable data caching to ensure we only download the required"
" data once."
msgstr ""
"在本次回测中，我们将使用 `Yahoo Finance <https://finance.yahoo.com>`__ 作为 `数据源 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.data.html#pybroker.data.DataSource>`__。我们还将启用数据缓存，以确保只下载一次所需的数据。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:62 a
#: c44b9f8cd0f640c8a2de1c7b3ad3cb72
msgid ""
"First, create a `StrategyConfig "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig>`__"
" object to configure the ``Strategy``. In this example, we set the "
"initial cash to ``500,000``:"
msgstr ""
"首先，创建一个 `StrategyConfig "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig>`__"
" 对象来配置 ``Strategy``。在本例中，我们将初始资金设置为 ``500,000``："

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:83 a
#: cffdbf7088b44cfbac62ec0abcbeadd1
msgid ""
"Next, create a new instance of the ``Strategy`` class by passing the "
"following arguments:"
msgstr "接下来，你可以通过传入以下参数来创建一个 ``Strategy`` 类的新实例："

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 5c78ff2a7fdc4dcd8c3afe66ca3bc8be Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:85 a
msgid "**Data source**: We use Yahoo Finance for this example."
msgstr "**数据源**：本示例使用 Yahoo Finance。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 7e2c5e84c1ac4bb39b103e5e7fc9d7d6 Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:86 a
msgid "**Start date**: The starting date for the backtest."
msgstr "**开始日期**：回测的起始日期。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:87 a
#: a449991137704087938b4b41fa51d079
msgid "**End date**: The ending date for the backtest."
msgstr "**结束日期**：回测的结束日期。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:88 a
#: eaff0d45390a45288e86f1ff09f1eecc
msgid "**Config**: The configuration object created earlier."
msgstr "**配置**：之前创建的配置对象。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 07b7e167ba2b4f97b4e49beb68c9f3bf Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:109 a
msgid ""
"The ``Strategy`` instance is now ready to download data from Yahoo "
"Finance for the period between March 1, 2017, and March 1, 2022. To "
"modify other settings, refer to the `StrategyConfig reference "
"documentation "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig>`__."
msgstr ""
"``Strategy`` 实例现在已准备好从 Yahoo Finance 下载 2017 年 3 月 1 日至 2022 年 3 月 1 "
"日期间的数据。如需修改其他设置，请参阅 `StrategyConfig 参考文档 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig>`__。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 1a4f929d71394503823227f8938dd2cf Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:112 a
msgid "Defining Strategy Rules"
msgstr "定义策略规则"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 1e9a9bbb89094e469c4333ccee02ceb3 Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:114 a
msgid ""
"In this section, you will implement a basic trading strategy in "
"**PyBroker** using the following rules:"
msgstr "在本节中，你将使用以下规则在 **PyBroker** 中实现一个基本的交易策略："

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 13be764ff72f462190a485916cb5bf44 Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:116 a
msgid ""
"Buy a stock if its last close price is lower than the previous bar's low,"
" provided there is no open long position for that stock."
msgstr "如果某只股票的最新收盘价低于前一根 K 线的最低价，且该股票没有未平仓的多头头寸，则买入该股票。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 9e18f1b87966446982a01f0aa4768a1a Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:117 a
msgid "Set the buy order's limit price to ``0.01`` below the last close price."
msgstr "将买单的限价设置为比最新收盘价低 ``0.01``。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 03ae673de9774eb3b77a5bded0cf11cc Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:118 a
msgid "Hold the position for 3 days before liquidating it at market price."
msgstr "持有头寸 3 天后以市价平仓。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 477cdd57533c48d3a28a56a7b462e252 Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:119 a
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Apply these rules to AAPL and MSFT, allocating up to 25% of the portfolio"
" to each."
msgstr "在 AAPL 和 MSFT 上执行这些规则，为每只股票分配最多 25% 的投资组合。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:121 a
#: dff121e565f84c87b05dd0128dab0147
msgid ""
"To accomplish this, define a ``buy_low`` function. **PyBroker** will call"
" this function separately for AAPL and MSFT on every data bar (where each"
" bar represents a single trading day):"
msgstr ""
"为此，定义一个 ``buy_low`` 函数。**PyBroker** 会在每根 K 线上分别为 AAPL 和 MSFT 调用该函数（每根 K "
"线代表一个交易日）："

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 543f117889c94d69b5e946b74e358424 Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:154 a
msgid ""
"The ``buy_low`` function receives an `ExecContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext>`__"
" (``ctx``) containing historical data for the current ticker (AAPL or "
"MSFT). You can access the most recent close price via ``ctx.close[-1]``."
msgstr ""
"``buy_low`` 函数接收一个 `ExecContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext>`__"
" （``ctx``），其中包含当前股票代码（AAPL 或 MSFT）的历史数据。你可以通过 ``ctx.close[-1]`` 获取最新的收盘价。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:156 a
#: e35091a1816b44e3baed4f5114f60c3b
msgid ""
"To place an order, calculate the 25% portfolio allocation using "
"`ctx.calc_target_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.calc_target_shares>`__"
" and assign it to `ctx.buy_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.buy_shares>`__."
" Then, set the limit price using `buy_limit_price "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.buy_limit_price>`__."
msgstr ""
"要下单，请使用 `ctx.calc_target_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.calc_target_shares>`__"
" 计算 25% 的投资组合分配，并将其赋值给 `ctx.buy_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.buy_shares>`__，然后使用"
" `buy_limit_price "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.buy_limit_price>`__"
" 设置限价。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:159 a
#: a407d74ad5144cc4af0903940745c97b
msgid ""
"By default, buy orders fill on the following bar (``buy_delay=1``) at the"
" `bar's midpoint price "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.PriceType.MIDDLE>`__."
" You can customize this behavior using `StrategyConfig.buy_delay "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.buy_delay>`__"
" and `ExecContext.buy_fill_price "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.buy_fill_price>`__."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，买单会在下一根 K 线（``buy_delay=1``）以 `该 K 线的中点价格 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.common.html#pybroker.common.PriceType.MIDDLE>`__"
" 成交。你可以通过 `StrategyConfig.buy_delay "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.buy_delay>`__"
" 和 `ExecContext.buy_fill_price "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.buy_fill_price>`__"
" 自定义此行为。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 6b71a6af23d04f77a205a1243b7f27b7 Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:162 a
msgid ""
"Next, use `ctx.hold_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.hold_bars>`__"
" to specify the holding period. Upon liquidation, shares are sold at the "
"`ExecContext.sell_fill_price "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.sell_fill_price>`__"
" (which also defaults to the bar's midpoint)."
msgstr ""
"接下来，使用 `ctx.hold_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.hold_bars>`__"
" 指定持仓周期。平仓时，股票将以 `ExecContext.sell_fill_price "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.sell_fill_price>`__"
" 价格卖出（该价格默认同样为该 K 线的中点价）。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:164 a
#: af110bea832a405bad316e46f8fc7ff9
msgid ""
"To apply these ``buy_low`` rules to AAPL and MSFT, use the `add_execution"
" "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__"
" method:"
msgstr ""
"要将这些 ``buy_low`` 规则应用于 AAPL 和 MSFT，请使用 `add_execution "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution>`__"
" 方法："

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:186 a
#: fdab8b8dbeca4f158f72d3d66f3b998a
msgid "Adding a Second Execution"
msgstr "添加第二个执行逻辑"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 92407b233ee94515a98f9b11c5ab62ff Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:188 a
msgid ""
"You can apply different trading rules to different tickers within the "
"same ``Strategy`` instance. To demonstrate this, let's define a new set "
"of rules for a short strategy in a function called ``short_high``, which "
"functions similarly to our previous rules:"
msgstr ""
"你可以在同一个 ``Strategy`` 实例中为不同的股票代码应用不同的交易规则。为了说明这一点，我们在一个名为 ``short_high`` "
"的函数中定义一组新的做空策略规则，其工作方式与之前的规则类似："

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:219 a
#: b913df89024c4d4bb41706917c2cefa7
msgid "The rules in ``short_high`` will be traded on ``TSLA``:"
msgstr "``short_high`` 中的规则将应用于 ``TSLA``："

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 9d764fa3fb374eb38db47efc3c91f86e Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:240 a
msgid ""
"(Note, you can also retrieve bar data for another symbol by calling "
"`ExecContext#foreign "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.foreign>`__)"
msgstr ""
"（注意，你还可以通过调用 `ExecContext#foreign "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.foreign>`__"
" 获取另一个股票代码的 K 线数据）"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 2c0b230c39ca44e8bd0a1ab9f0eba51b Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:252 a
msgid "Running a Backtest"
msgstr "运行回测"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:254 a
#: a3a3dcca6fc549b799194c150b7cf36c
msgid ""
"To run a backtest, call the `backtest "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest>`__"
" method on the ``Strategy`` instance. Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"要运行回测，请在 Strategy 实例上调用 `backtest "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest>`__"
" 方法。以下是一个例子："

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 3c7edae017ab40c885678d552faba5d2 Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:416 a
msgid ""
"The ``backtest`` method returns a `TestResult "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.TestResult>`__"
" object containing detailed metrics from your backtest. For instance, you"
" can use `Matplotlib <https://matplotlib.org/>`__ to plot the portfolio's"
" daily market value:"
msgstr ""
"``backtest`` 方法会返回一个 `TestResult "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.TestResult>`__"
" 对象，其中包含回测的详细指标。例如，你可以使用 `Matplotlib <https://matplotlib.org/>`__ "
"绘制投资组合每日市值的图表："

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 62b923da9d28402ab216039e02d09059 Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:474 a
msgid ""
"You can also access the executed trades for every entry and exit, along "
"with all placed orders:"
msgstr "你还可以访问每次进出场的成交交易记录，以及所有已下达的订单："

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 4db3b498b1df4c328340c63c97c2dbb1 Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:1207 a
msgid ""
"Additionally, ``result.metrics_df`` provides a DataFrame of metrics "
"calculated from the backtest returns. You can find detailed explanations "
"of these metrics in the `reference documentation "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics>`__."
msgstr ""
"此外，``result.metrics_df`` 提供一个根据回测收益率计算得出的指标 DataFrame。你可以在 `参考文档 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics>`__"
" 中查看这些指标的详细说明。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. Backtesting Strategy.ipynb:1612 a
#: eff1668eb3a94827aac47cdaf5c047de
msgid "Filtering Backtest Data"
msgstr "筛选回测数据"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 92ee9e7a51c840ac969ecf8e8be419ee Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:1614 a
msgid ""
"You can filter the backtest data to include only specific bars. For "
"example, to restrict the strategy to trading on Mondays, simply filter "
"the data to keep only Monday bars:"
msgstr "你可以筛选回测数据，仅保留特定的 K 线。例如，要将策略限制为仅在周一交易，只需筛选数据以仅保留周一的 K 线："

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 7e5e98c796ff41559ea923e6a69263cc Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:2052 a
msgid ""
"Because data caching is enabled, **PyBroker** filtered the local data "
"without re-downloading it from Yahoo Finance."
msgstr "由于启用了数据缓存，**PyBroker** 直接筛选本地数据，而无需从 Yahoo Finance 重新下载。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 6102b2da4c8d4aa5a2bea9d447942163 Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:2054 a
msgid ""
"You can also filter data by specific time ranges (such as 9:30 to 10:30 "
"AM) using the `between_time "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest>`__"
" argument."
msgstr ""
"你还可以使用 `between_time "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest>`__"
" 参数按特定时间范围（例如 9:30 至 10:30 AM）筛选数据。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/2. 63e52a48eeb14d19b9d01d507f2debe1 Backtesting
#: Strategy.ipynb:2056 a
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Although the metrics earlier indicate that we have a profitable strategy,"
" we may have been misled by randomness. `In the next notebook, we'll "
"discuss how to use bootstrapping to further evaluate our trading "
"strategies "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/3.%20Evaluating%20with%20Bootstrap%20Metrics.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"尽管之前的指标表明我们拥有一个盈利的策略，但我们也可能被随机性误导。`在下一篇文档中，我们将讨论如何使用自助法进一步评估我们的交易策略 "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/3.%20Evaluating%20with%20Bootstrap%20Metrics.html>`__。"

